# Velox Proxima (VP) — CNN MNIST
# High-performance Convolutional Neural Network.
# Optimized for NVIDIA GPUs with Auto-Mixed Precision (AMP).

layer Conv2D (16, 3)
layer BatchNorm ()
layer Conv2D (32, 3)
layer BatchNorm ()
layer Dense (128)

layer ReLU ()
layer Dropout (0.2)
layer Dense (10)

train on mnist
optimizer adam lr=0.001
epochs 5
batch_size 128
loss cross_entropy

save models/mnist_cnn.pt
plot live
eval on test

